  "statement": "The Catalan numbers C_n describe the count of valid parenthesis expressions of length 2n, full binary trees with n+1 leaves, and triangulations of convex polygons with n+2 vertices.\nFormula: C_n = (1 / (n + 1)) * (2n choose n).\n\nGiven N, compute C_N modulo 10^9 + 7.",
  "inputFormat": "A single non-negative integer N.",
  "outputFormat": "Print C_N % 1000000007.",
  "constraints": "0 <= N <= 1000",
